{"name": "SwooshCat", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"279\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ee0b4686df590e1306ba00948c375a6d.avif?t=1755089349\" width=\"720\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SwooshCat \u2013 A precision platformer starring an adorable feline! Master simple jumps and dashes to embark on a challenging yet delightful adventure. \ud83d\udc3e</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Slash, Parry, Break, Dodge \u2013 Your dash isn't just movement: it's a combat blade and puzzle key!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/f005732d3c0a78338f2ab28f34a1b545.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explore lush jungles and scorching deserts, each meticulously packed with deadly traps and cunning mechanisms to challenge your skills and strategy!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/b3274a996a1697c8b56c07031483331c.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Turn foes into stepping stones \u2013 Chain kills, parries, and dashes to bounce off corpses and bullets, resetting mobility to reach \"impossible\" corners!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/ce6f1457d80553654dfeb91dad59cb9b.mp4?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Easy to learn, deep to master: Newbies leap right in; speedrunners face brutal challenges!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.poster.avif?t=1755089349\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.webm?t=1755089349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442170/extras/6e57a81743d89ac6f8816b2ab1fb353a.mp4?t=1755089349\" ty